===Etymology===
{{inh+|en|enm|lymon}}, from {{der|en|fro|lymon||citrus}}, from {{der|en|ar|لَيْمُون}} or {{der|en|fa|لیمون|tr=limon}}, from {{der|en|fa|لیمو|tr=limu}}, from {{der|en|sa|निम्बू||lime}}, ultimately from {{der|en|poz-pro|*limaw}} or {{der|en|mun||lime}}.<ref>{{R:Etymonline|lemon}}</ref> Likely {{dbt|en|lime|id1=fruit|nocap=1}}.

The fandom sense is named after the erotic anime series ''{{w|Cream Lemon}}''.<ref>Maria Lindgren Leavenworth & Malin Isaksson, ''Fanged Fan Fiction: Variations on Twilight, True Blood and The Vampire Diaries'', [https://books.google.com/books?id=4foQAAAAQBAJ&pg=PA118&dq=%22cream+lemon%22 page 118]</ref>

